      "source": "<li><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"0\">Description</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#constructor-summary\" tabindex=\"0\">Constructor Summary</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#method-summary\" tabindex=\"0\">Method Summary</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#constructor-detail\" tabindex=\"0\">Constructor Details</a>\n<ol class=\"toc-list\">\n<li><a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E()\" tabindex=\"0\">DefaultMethodInvokingMethodInterceptor()</a></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"#method-detail\" tabindex=\"0\">Method Details</a>\n<ol class=\"toc-list\">\n<li><a href=\"#hasDefaultMethods(java.lang.Class)\" tabindex=\"0\">hasDefaultMethods(Class)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#invoke(org.aopalliance.intercept.MethodInvocation)\" tabindex=\"0\">invoke(MethodInvocation)</a></li>\n</ol>\n</li>",
